---
import Main from "../../layouts/Main.astro";
import PageHeader from "../../components/PageHeader.astro";
---

<Main title="AI Workstations for Quant & Finance - Aurora Nyxus" description="Owned, private, low-latency AI compute for funds and trading desks. Your models stay in the building.">
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Quant & finance"
    title="Private compute for models that stay in the building"
    lede="Owned, private, fast compute for funds and trading desks. Discretion is default."
    accent="signal"
    bgSrc="/images/hardware/hero-bg-workstation.webp"
    bgAlt="Premium workstation for private finance compute"
  />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20 sm:py-28">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-medium text-ink sm:text-3xl">Why owned, for finance</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-graphite">
          Proprietary models are the edge. Sending them to a shared cloud is a
          leak and a latency tax. An owned node keeps the model, the data, and
          the inference in the building, under your control.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-medium text-ink sm:text-3xl">How we work</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-graphite">
          Quiet, specced to the strategy, stress-tested, delivered and set up.
          We build the box; what you run on it is yours.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="grid gap-px border border-hairline bg-hairline sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="bg-canvas p-7 sm:p-8">
        <p class="mono-label mb-3 text-signal">01</p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-ink">Low latency</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite">On-desk or on-prem. No hyperscaler round-trip.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-canvas p-7 sm:p-8">
        <p class="mono-label mb-3 text-aurora-green">02</p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-ink">Private by default</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite">Models and data never leave. No shared tenancy.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-canvas p-7 sm:p-8">
        <p class="mono-label mb-3 text-aurora-violet">03</p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-ink">Discreet</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite">We build quietly. Your edge stays yours.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 pb-24 pt-8 sm:pb-32">
    <a href="/contact#request-a-build" class="inline-block rounded-sm border border-signal/50 bg-signal/10 px-6 py-3 font-mono text-sm font-medium text-signal transition-colors hover:bg-signal/20">Request a private build</a>
  </section>
</Main>
